<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Yeni Parti Kocaeli'nin gelir ve giderleri a\u00e7\u0131kland\u0131! Bor\u00e7lar \u00f6denince kasada ne kalacak?","articleSection":"Kocaeli Haber","dateCreated":"2026-10-24T13:33:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-24T13:33:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-24T13:40:30+03:00","wordCount":480,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.kocaelitv.com.tr\/yeni-parti-kocaelinin-gelir-ve-giderleri-aciklandi-borclar-odenince-kasada-ne-kalacak"},"articleBody":"Yeni Parti Kocaeli \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'n\u0131n 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi'nde te\u015fkilat\u0131n mali durumu delegelerle payla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130l Saymanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan 23 Ekim 2026 tarihi itibar\u0131yla haz\u0131rlanan gelir, gider, banka bakiyesi ve bor\u00e7 tablosu kongre salonundaki ekrana yans\u0131t\u0131ld\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131klanan rakamlara g\u00f6re te\u015fkilat\u0131n toplam geliri 769 bin 506 lira 97 kuru\u015f, gideri ise 666 bin 738 lira 69 kuru\u015f oldu. Banka hesab\u0131ndaki mevcut paradan bor\u00e7 tutar\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcld\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde ise geriye 102 bin 785 lira 4 kuru\u015f kalaca\u011f\u0131 belirtildi.\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 PART\u0130 KOCAEL\u0130'N\u0130N GEL\u0130R VE G\u0130DERLER\u0130 A\u00c7IKLANDI\r\n\r\nKocaeli Kongre Merkezi'nde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen Yeni Parti Kocaeli 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi'nde te\u015fkilat\u0131n mali faaliyetleri de g\u00fcndeme geldi.\u0130l Saymanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan haz\u0131rlanan mali raporda, te\u015fkilat\u0131n kurulu\u015f s\u00fcrecinden itibaren elde etti\u011fi gelirler, yap\u0131lan harcamalar, mevcut banka bakiyesi ve \u00f6denmesi gereken bor\u00e7lar delegelerin bilgisine sunuldu.A\u00e7\u0131klanan verilere g\u00f6re Yeni Parti Kocaeli \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'n\u0131n ba\u011f\u0131\u015f ve aidatlardan elde etti\u011fi toplam gelir 769 bin 506 lira 97 kuru\u015f olarak kaydedildi. Te\u015fkilat\u0131n kurulu\u015f ve \u00f6rg\u00fctlenme faaliyetleri kapsam\u0131nda yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 toplam harcama ise 666 bin 738 lira 69 kuru\u015fa ula\u015ft\u0131.\r\n\r\nGelir ve gider aras\u0131ndaki fark 102 bin 768 lira 28 kuru\u015f olarak hesapland\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEN B\u00dcY\u00dcK HARCAMA KALEM\u0130 K\u0130RALAMA OLDU\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Kocaeli \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'n\u0131n gider tablosunda en y\u00fcksek harcama kalemini kiralama giderleri olu\u015fturdu.\r\n\r\nA\u00e7\u0131klanan mali verilere g\u00f6re toplam 666 bin 738 lira 69 kuru\u015fluk giderin yakla\u015f\u0131k 300 bin liras\u0131 kiralama harcamalar\u0131na ayr\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\nB\u00f6ylece kiralama giderleri, te\u015fkilat\u0131n toplam harcamalar\u0131n\u0131n yakla\u015f\u0131k y\u00fczde 45'ini olu\u015fturdu.\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 PART\u0130 KOCAEL\u0130'N\u0130N BANKA HESABINDA NE KADAR PARA VAR?\r\n\r\nKongrede a\u00e7\u0131klanan banka bilgilerine g\u00f6re Yeni Parti Kocaeli \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'n\u0131n hesab\u0131nda 126 bin 785 lira 4 kuru\u015f bulunuyor.\r\n\r\nMali tabloda te\u015fkilat\u0131n mevcut borcu da a\u00e7\u0131kland\u0131. Buna g\u00f6re il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n SMSMaks Telekom\u00fcnikasyon Sanayi ve Ticaret firmas\u0131na 24 bin liral\u0131k SMS hizmet bedeli borcu bulunuyor.\r\n\r\nA\u00e7\u0131klanan raporda ba\u015fka bir bor\u00e7 kalemine yer verilmedi.\r\n\r\nBOR\u00c7LAR \u00d6DEND\u0130\u011e\u0130NDE KASADA 102 B\u0130N L\u0130RA KALACAK\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Kocaeli \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'n\u0131n banka hesab\u0131ndaki 126 bin 785 lira 4 kuru\u015ftan, 24 bin liral\u0131k mevcut bor\u00e7 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcld\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde geriye 102 bin 785 lira 4 kuru\u015f kal\u0131yor.\r\n\r\nB\u00f6ylece te\u015fkilat\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131klanan banka bakiyesi ve bor\u00e7 bilgilerine g\u00f6re, mevcut borcun tamam\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6denmesi durumunda hesapta yakla\u015f\u0131k 102 bin 785 lira bulunacak.\r\n\r\nGEL\u0130R-G\u0130DER FARKI \u0130LE BANKA BAK\u0130YES\u0130 ARASINDA 16 L\u0130RALIK FARK\r\n\r\nKongrede payla\u015f\u0131lan mali tabloda dikkat \u00e7eken bir di\u011fer ayr\u0131nt\u0131 ise gelir-gider fark\u0131 ile bor\u00e7 sonras\u0131 banka bakiyesi aras\u0131ndaki k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck farkl\u0131l\u0131k oldu.\r\n\r\nGelir ve gider aras\u0131ndaki fark 102 bin 768 lira 28 kuru\u015f olarak hesaplan\u0131rken, banka hesab\u0131ndan mevcut bor\u00e7 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcld\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde kalan tutar 102 bin 785 lira 4 kuru\u015f olarak ortaya \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131","description":"Yeni Parti Kocaeli \u0130l Kongresi'nde mali tablo a\u00e7\u0131kland\u0131. 769 bin liral\u0131k gelire kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k 666 bin lira harcand\u0131. Bor\u00e7 sonras\u0131 kalan para belli oldu.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kocaelitvcomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/kocaelitv-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/10\/yeniprt.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Yeni Parti Kocaeli'nin gelir ve giderleri a\u00e7\u0131kland\u0131! Bor\u00e7lar \u00f6denince kasada ne kalacak?"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kocaelitv.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Kocaeli TV","image":"https:\/\/kocaelitvcomtr.teimg.com\/kocaelitv-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/09\/kocaeli-tv-logo.svg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kocaelitvcomtr.teimg.com\/kocaelitv-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/09\/kocaeli-tv-logo.svg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bug\u00fcn Kocaeli","url":"https:\/\/www.kocaelitv.com.tr"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Haber Merkezi","url":"https:\/\/www.kocaelitv.com.tr\/muhabir\/74640\/haber-merkezi"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kocaelitv.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Kocaeli TV","url":"https:\/\/www.kocaelitv.com.tr"}}</script>


