<img src="https://kocaelitvcomtr.teimg.com/kocaelitv-com-tr/uploads/2025/09/kocaeli-tv-logo.svg" alt="Kocaeli Haberleri, Son Dakika Kocaeli Haber | Kocaeli TV" width="150" height="40" class="dark-mode img-fluid flow-logo d-none">

